      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carnegie%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Carnegie was renamed to honor philanthropist Andrew Carnegie, partly to avoid conflict with another Oklahoma town named Latham.",
